@startuml
title D-02 Operator Console Module Boundary Diagram

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Operator Console\nnon-payment governance" as Console {
  component "Session lookup display" as Lookup
  component "Statutory discount review" as DiscountReview
  component "Evidence review" as Evidence
  component "Continuity approval / review" as ContinuityReview
  component "Fiscal exception review" as FiscalReview
  component "Manual release governance" as Manual
  component "Operator reports" as Reports
}

component "Assisted Payment Terminal\ncashier / continuity payment workflow" as APT
component "WebPay\ncustomer payment surface" as WebPay
component "Payment Orchestrator\nprovider interaction" as Pay
component "Site POS Server\nSales Invoice issuer" as POS
component "Central PMS\npayment finality + ExitAuthorization" as Central
component "Gate / Exit\nexecution" as Gate

Console ..> APT : review / supervise, not replace
Console ..> WebPay : status context only
Console ..> Pay : no direct provider interaction
Console ..> POS : fiscal status review only
Console ..> Central : approved governance workflows
Console ..> Gate : no direct gate execution

note bottom of Console
Operator Console may display states,
but authority remains with Central PMS,
Discount workflow, POS Server, and gate systems.
end note

@enduml
